      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DU CLISSON (4) resumes as the horse to beat on a profile that is well suited to 1000m at this venue. Her last preparation ended with a Caulfield Heath BM70 run where she was beaten just over three lengths despite racing wide throughout, and she had earlier been competitive in a BM66 at this track. Three trials should have her right to go. CRICKWOOD (7) resumes with a trial win behind her, boasting a strong record at this track and a previous win from one try around 1000m. Should run well fresh. LEANTOTHEMOON (2) brings the strongest current campaign form of the rest, coming off a close BM74 fourth after winning a BM56 at Moe. In the each-way mix. TWISTER (3) resumed with a solid maiden win here and will give a sight again.",
